{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "digital-dad-api-2024",
		"name": "数字爸爸 API",
		"description": "数字爸爸 - 婚礼采访与生成平台 API 测试用例\n\n使用说明：\n1. 先调用「认证-发送验证码」获取验证码\n2. 调用「认证-主持人登录」或「认证-超管登录」获取 token（均为 POST /api/auth/login，超管登录时 body 增加 \"admin\": true）\n3. 主持人 token 存入变量 token，超管 token 存入 adminToken（登录接口 Tests 已自动处理）\n4. 当前用户、项目、板块、用户资料等统一路径，主持人/超管用各自 token 即可\n5. 需认证接口使用 Authorization: Bearer {{token}} 或 {{adminToken}}\n6. 「获取分享入口」返回 entryUrl、qrCodeUrl、wechatScheme、wechatSchemeQrCodeUrl；成功后会自动把 shareToken 写入集合变量，便于在「C端-入口-扫码入口」中直接使用\n7. C 端会话按板块：先调「获取 my-status」，再调「进入项目采访」传 projectId + projectBoardId（my-status 成功后会写入 projectBoardId、sessionId，可直接用「进入项目采访」）",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080"},
		{"key": "token", "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwicm9sZXMiOlsiSE9TVCIsIlNVUEVSX0FETUlOIl0sInBob25lIjoiMTM2MjM2NDE1MDEiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzM0NjYyMjYsImV4cCI6MTc3MzU1MjYyNn0.I4-pvVE60rQgQKfvS-k6_GQcItpYM2_NWuHVAHb2uGD0poNspaQbW1c2SfxjsDDq"},
		{"key": "adminToken", "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwicm9sZXMiOlsiSE9TVCIsIlNVUEVSX0FETUlOIl0sInBob25lIjoiMTM2MjM2NDE1MDEiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzM0NjYyMjYsImV4cCI6MTc3MzU1MjYyNn0.I4-pvVE60rQgQKfvS-k6_GQcItpYM2_NWuHVAHb2uGD0poNspaQbW1c2SfxjsDDq"},
		{"key": "projectId", "value": "3"},
		{"key": "projectBoardId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "sessionId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "messageId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "summaryId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "itemId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "personId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "deliverableId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "templateId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "versionId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "sceneId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "hostId", "value": "1"},
		{"key": "shareToken", "value": "your-share-token"},
		{"key": "phone", "value": "13623641501"},
		{"key": "baseUrlWs", "value": "ws://101.34.64.224:8080"}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "公共",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "根路径-服务状态",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "健康检查",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health"
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "认证",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "发送验证码",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-code"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "主持人登录(admin不传或false)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": ["var json = pm.response.json(); if (json.data && json.data.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token); }"],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "当前用户(主持人/超管共用)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "退出登录",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "超管登录(admin:true)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": ["var json = pm.response.json(); if (json.data && json.data.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', json.data.token); }"],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\",\n  \"admin\": true\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "当前用户(超管token)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "密码登录",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"password\": \"your_password\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login-password"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "微信小程序登录",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"前端 wx.login() 获得的临时 code，必填\",\n  \"nickName\": \"微信用户\",\n  \"avatarUrl\": \"https://...\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/wechat-login",
						"description": "C 端微信小程序登录。前端调用 wx.login() 得到 code 后传到此接口；后端用 code 调微信 jscode2session 换 openid，查/建用户、写登录流水并签发 JWT。body 必填 code；nickName、avatarUrl 等可选，用于完善用户资料。测试时 code 需为小程序真实获取的临时凭证（5 分钟有效）。"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "设置/修改密码",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"newPassword\": \"new_password\",\n  \"oldPassword\": null\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/set-password"
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "C端-入口(免认证)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "扫码入口-获取项目信息",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/entry/{{shareToken}}"
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "C端-绑定与会话",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "获取my-status(当前用户在该项目下的状态)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/projects/{{projectId}}/my-status",
						"description": "返回当前用户在该项目下的步骤（step）、sessionId、currentProjectBoardId、板块列表等。\n\n- sessionId 为当前应进入板块的会话（有则返回，无则 null）；为 null 时用 currentProjectBoardId 调「进入项目采访」。\n- 会话按板块：换板块需重新调 POST /api/c/sessions 传新的 projectBoardId。"
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.data && json.data.currentProjectBoardId != null) {",
									"  pm.collectionVariables.set('projectBoardId', json.data.currentProjectBoardId);",
									"}",
									"if (json.data && json.data.sessionId != null) {",
									"  pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId', json.data.sessionId);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "进入项目采访(绑定+创建/恢复该板块会话)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"projectId\": {{projectId}},\n  \"projectBoardId\": {{projectBoardId}},\n  \"role\": \"GROOM\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions",
						"description": "一步完成「选身份绑定 + 创建或恢复该板块的会话」。会话按板块：一个 session 仅对应某用户在某板块下的对话，换板块会产生新 session。\n\n- body 必填：projectId、projectBoardId（可从 my-status 的 currentProjectBoardId 取得）。\n- 未绑定时必填 role（GROOM/BRIDE）；已绑定时 role 可省略。\n- 成功响应后 Tests 会将 sessionId 写入集合变量。"
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.data && json.data.id) {",
									"  pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId', json.data.id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "进入项目采访-已绑定(projectId+projectBoardId)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"projectId\": {{projectId}},\n  \"projectBoardId\": {{projectBoardId}}\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions",
						"description": "已绑定用户进入/恢复某板块会话，body 传 projectId + projectBoardId（无需 role）。建议先调 my-status 获取 currentProjectBoardId，或使用集合变量 projectBoardId。"
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.data && json.data.id) {",
									"  pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId', json.data.id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "获取会话",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "获取消息列表",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "发送消息",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"测试消息内容\",\n  \"audioUrl\": null,\n  \"transcriptText\": null\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "更新消息",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"更新后的内容\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages/{{messageId}}"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "删除消息",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages/{{messageId}}"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "提交会话",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/submit"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "流式提交(WebSocket)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": "{{baseUrlWs}}/api/c/ws/submit-stream?token={{token}}",
						"description": "WebSocket 流式提交：连接后发送一条文本消息 {\"sessionId\": <sessionId>}，服务端会推送 type=delta 的 AI 增量、最后一条 type=done（含 messageId、roundCount）或 type=error。\n\n使用步骤：\n1. 确保 baseUrlWs 与当前环境一致（如本地为 ws://localhost:8080）；\n2. 先调用「主持人登录」或「微信小程序登录」获取 token，并确保有 sessionId（可先「进入项目采访」再「获取会话」或从 my-status 取得）；\n3. 在 Postman 中新建 WebSocket Request，URL 填 {{baseUrlWs}}/api/c/ws/submit-stream?token={{token}}；\n4. Connect 后，在 Send 框输入 {\"sessionId\": {{sessionId}}} 发送；\n5. 在响应区查看逐条 delta 与最终 done/error。"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "获取语音转写配额",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/speech-quota"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "实时语音转写(WebSocket)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": "{{baseUrlWs}}/api/c/ws/speech-recognition?token={{token}}",
						"description": "实时语音转写 WebSocket。\n\nToken：URL 参数 ?token={{token}} 或 Header Authorization: Bearer {{token}}。\n\n连接后发送 Binary（PCM 16k/16bit/mono，约 100～200ms/包）或 Text \"end\"/\"stop\" 结束。服务端返回 Text：{\"type\":\"transcript\",\"text\":\"...\"} 或 {\"type\":\"error\",\"message\":\"...\"}。\n\n用本地音频文件自测（无需手发 Binary）：\n1. cd scripts/speech-recognition-ws-client && npm install\n2. TOKEN={{token}} node send-audio.js <你的.wav或.pcm> [--url={{baseUrlWs}}]\n3. 音频须为 PCM 16k/16bit/单声道；.wav 会自动去头。详见 scripts/speech-recognition-ws-client/README.md"
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "C端-小结",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "创建小结",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/summaries",
						"description": "根据当前会话对话由 AI 生成小结并立即确认（事实 + 关键人物），解析入库后写入素材快照、推进板块进度。响应 data 为小结对象，含 items、keyPersons，状态为已确认。"
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.data && json.data.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('summaryId', json.data.id); }",
									"if (json.data) {",
									"  pm.test('data 含 items', function() { pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('items'); });",
									"  pm.test('data 含 keyPersons', function() { pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('keyPersons'); });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "获取当前小结",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/summaries/current",
						"description": "获取该会话下当前有效的一份小结。响应 data 含 items、keyPersons；无小结时 data 为 null。"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "获取小结详情",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/board-summaries/{{summaryId}}",
						"description": "根据小结 ID 查询详情。响应 data 为板块小结对象，含 items（事实/表达）、keyPersons（本小结绑定的关键人物）。"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "添加小结条目",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"事实内容\",\n  \"itemType\": \"FACT\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/board-summaries/{{summaryId}}/items"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "更新小结条目",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"更新内容\",\n  \"itemType\": \"FACT\",\n  \"isSelected\": true\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/summary-items/{{itemId}}"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "删除小结条目",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/summary-items/{{itemId}}"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "设置小结关键人物",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"keyPersonIds\": [1, 2]\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/board-summaries/{{summaryId}}/key-persons",
						"description": "设置本小结绑定的关键人物 ID 列表（须为当前用户已有的关键人物）。未确认的小结可修改；已确认后不可改。之后获取小结详情/当前小结时 keyPersons 即为此列表。"
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "C端-故事与人物",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "创建故事",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/stories"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "获取故事",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/stories?projectBoardId=1"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "获取关键人物列表",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/c/sessions/{{sessionId}}/persons"
					}
				},
				{
